+    // emulator is slow enough that threads routinely miss the timeout — which is
+    // why the crash reproduced on device but not the (faster) simulator.
+    // Recycling this memory caused use-after-free heap corruption ("BUG IN
+    // CLIENT OF LIBMALLOC: corruption of free block") under heavy thread churn
